<title>USA: YES! stake raised by Indonesia investor.</title>
<headline>YES! stake raised by Indonesia investor.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Andyla Yasa, a Jakarta, Indonesia, investor said Thursday he raised his stake in YES! Entertainment Corp to 912,500 common shares or 6.1 percent from 5.1 percent held previously.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Yasa said his latest transactions include the purchase of 147,000 common shares bought between Dec 18 and 27 at $6.55 to $7.4875 per share.</p>
<p>Yasa said he holds the stake in the Pleasanton, Calif., company for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
